    "authorityFinding": "INP detailed inventory p1447 describes Tijma as a rural locality with houses dispersed among small hills. Its separate summary p22 (printed19), under the delegation column established on p6, assigns Tijma168.014 and Sidi Touati168.015 to MATMATA NOUVELLE. TAP26May2025 also names Tijma among villages in new Matmata.",
    "locationCrossCheck": "The source named cemetery Tijma - Sidi Touati is approximately4.84m from the INP Sidi Touati point after documented datum conversion. This corroborates geographic context; it does not certify the cemetery or locality border."
